{"seq":3,"slug":"lateness-review-and-appeal","title":"超时争议复核与判定申诉","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/guaranteed-delivery-sla-promise/lateness-determination/lateness-review-and-appeal","wordCount":2972,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"超时争议复核与判定申诉\">超时争议复核与判定申诉</h1><p>超时判定引擎产出的是一个<strong>结论</strong>，不是一个<strong>事实</strong>。它把「承诺截止时刻」与「妥投事件」两条口径相减；但两条口径都可能错——承诺日因节假日日历陈旧而偏早，妥投扫描可能先扫后送、也可能是逆向单撤销前的残留。判定一旦直接连到赔付出口，这些误差就变成真金白银。复核与申诉是判定下游的第二道工序：<strong>在赔付发出或拒赔成立之前，让利益相关方有机会用新证据推翻一个自动结论</strong>，它同时是风控面（挡住刷申诉）和合规面（监管与卡组织都要求一个可到达的人工复核入口）。本文只讨论「判定已经成立、有人不服」之后的处理，判定口径见<a href=\"delivery-event-and-lateness-basis\">妥投事件与超时判定口径</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-申诉方与诉求分类\">核心概念：申诉方与诉求分类</h2><p>把申诉方按<strong>利益方向</strong>分类，而不按渠道分类，是设计复核队列的第一步。同一个买家投诉可能从客服工单、A-to-z 理赔、卡组织拒付三个入口同时进来，若不复用同一套判定快照，就会出现「客服判退款、卡组织判败诉」的矛盾。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>申诉方</th>\n<th>诉求</th>\n<th>常见触发</th>\n<th>需要的证据方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>买家</td>\n<td>主张未在承诺期内收到，要求退款或补偿</td>\n<td>实际感到慢、或商品未到</td>\n<td>妥投事实的反证：无扫描、错误投递</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卖家</td>\n<td>主张超时不应归责，要求免除 OTDR 扣分或撤回赔付</td>\n<td>平台考核扣分、赔付侵蚀毛利</td>\n<td>免责事由证据：清关卡滞、买家原因、承运商缺扫</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>承运商</td>\n<td>主张自己未超承诺时刻，拒绝退运费或拒赔</td>\n<td>服务保证退款请求被驳回</td>\n<td>承运商 commit time 与自身扫描时刻的比对</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内部审计</td>\n<td>主张判定不可信，要求抽查重算</td>\n<td>指标异常波动、口径版本切换</td>\n<td>判定输入指纹与重算结果的一致性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>四者的证据方向<strong>相互对立</strong>：买家要证明「没收到」，卖家要证明「不是我的责」，承运商要证明「我按时了」。复核系统必须能对同一条运单挂载<strong>多头结论</strong>，而非争夺一个布尔值。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;判定引擎输出&lt;br/&gt;准时 / 超时 / 待定&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;申诉入口&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|买家| C1[&quot;A-to-z / MBG / 拒付&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|卖家| C2[&quot;考核申诉 / 赔付争议&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|承运商| C3[&quot;服务保证退款驳回&quot;]&#10;    C1 --&gt; D[&quot;统一取判定快照&lt;br/&gt;事件集 + 承诺 + 口径版本&quot;]&#10;    C2 --&gt; D&#10;    C3 --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt; E{&quot;自动预审&lt;br/&gt;新证据是否足以翻转?&quot;}&#10;    E --&gt;|证据充分| F[&quot;自动裁定&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt;|证据冲突或超阈值| G[&quot;人工复核队列&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt;|超出受理窗口| H[&quot;驳回并告知窗口&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; I[&quot;回写判定 + 冲正/补发赔付&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; I\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"判定引擎输出&lt;br/&gt;准时 / 超时 / 待定\"] --&gt; B{\"申诉入口\"}\n    B --&gt;|买家| C1[\"A-to-z / MBG / 拒付\"]\n    B --&gt;|卖家| C2[\"考核申诉 / 赔付争议\"]\n    B --&gt;|承运商| C3[\"服务保证退款驳回\"]\n    C1 --&gt; D[\"统一取判定快照&lt;br/&gt;事件集 + 承诺 + 口径版本\"]\n    C2 --&gt; D\n    C3 --&gt; D\n    D --&gt; E{\"自动预审&lt;br/&gt;新证据是否足以翻转?\"}\n    E --&gt;|证据充分| F[\"自动裁定\"]\n    E --&gt;|证据冲突或超阈值| G[\"人工复核队列\"]\n    E --&gt;|超出受理窗口| H[\"驳回并告知窗口\"]\n    F --&gt; I[\"回写判定 + 冲正/补发赔付\"]\n    G --&gt; I</pre><h2 id=\"受理窗口-申诉不是一个可以无限重开的口\">受理窗口：申诉不是一个可以无限重开的口</h2><p>受理时效是复核系统最容易被忽略的硬约束，它由<strong>外部规则</strong>决定而非产品偏好，且买家侧与卖家侧窗口错位是常态。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>通道</th>\n<th>受理窗口（以当期条款为准）</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Amazon A-to-z Guarantee</td>\n<td>自最早可索赔日起约 90 天</td>\n<td>Amazon 买家保证条款，amazon.com</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>eBay Money Back Guarantee</td>\n<td>自预计送达日起约 30 天</td>\n<td>eBay 官方保证说明，ebay.com</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PayPal 买家保护</td>\n<td>自交易日起约 180 天</td>\n<td>PayPal 用户协议，paypal.com</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Visa 13.1 未收到商品</td>\n<td>自交易或交付日起约 120 天</td>\n<td>Visa Core Rules，usa.visa.com</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mastercard 4853</td>\n<td>自交易日起约 120 天</td>\n<td>Mastercard 争议规则，mastercard.com</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>承运商服务保证退款</td>\n<td>派送后特定期限内</td>\n<td>UPS / FedEx / DHL 当期 Service Guarantee 条款</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>窗口设计有两个工程含义。<strong>第一，判定快照必须长期留存</strong>——争议可能在判定成立 120 天后才由卡组织发起，届时原始轨迹事件、当时的口径版本、承诺计算输入都必须可重建。<strong>第二，超期未申诉的争议须自动落「不再受理」终态</strong>，而非永远挂在队列污染指标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复核裁定模型-证据权重与阈值\">复核裁定模型：证据权重与阈值</h2><p>裁定不是「看谁说得有理」，而是一个可复算的加权函数：把每类证据映射成分值再与阈值比较，裁定便因此可解释、可审计、可随口径版本迭代。定义证据集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">E</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{E} = \\{e_1, \\dots, e_n\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0894em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，每类证据有可信度权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（与判定引擎的 L1–L5 证据层级同源）与方向 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_i \\in \\{+1, -1\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>裁定</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>推翻（改判准时）</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>rev</mtext></msub></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>维持（超时成立）</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>keep</mtext></msub></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>人工复核</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>keep</mtext></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>rev</mtext></msub></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} w_i \\cdot d_i \\cdot e_i, \\qquad\n\\text{裁定} =\n\\begin{cases}\n\\text{推翻（改判准时）} &amp; S \\ge \\theta_{\\text{rev}} \\\\\n\\text{维持（超时成立）} &amp; S \\le \\theta_{\\text{keep}} \\\\\n\\text{人工复核} &amp; \\theta_{\\text{keep}} &lt; S &lt; \\theta_{\\text{rev}}\n\\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">裁定</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.32em;vertical-align:-1.91em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.35em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.192em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎨</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.292em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎧</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.85em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">推翻（改判准时）</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">维持（超时成立）</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">人工复核</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rev</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">keep</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">keep</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rev</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>中间的<strong>灰区</strong>是关键设计。两端都设阈值而非单阈值，让「证据冲突但都不弱」的争议（例如买家投诉未收到、但承运商报了 <code>X1</code> Delivered）进入人工队列，而非被草率自动吞掉。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>rev</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_{\\text{rev}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rev</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 太低会纵容刷申诉，太高会让真实误判的买家永远失败；实务上按争议<strong>金额分层</strong>设阈值，低金额走自动、高金额进人工。</p>\n<p>证据方向与权重映射：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>证据</th>\n<th>方向</th>\n<th>权重档</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>签收影像 + 签名（ePOD）</td>\n<td>-1</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>直接反证「未交付」主张</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>承运商妥投扫描（<code>X1</code>）</td>\n<td>-1</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>买家主张未收到时的主要抗辩证据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>派送尝试记录 + 通知留痕</td>\n<td>-1</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>支持「买家原因」免责</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>清关放行时间戳</td>\n<td>-1</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>支持清关卡滞免责</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>承运商服务中断公告</td>\n<td>-1</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>支持不可抗力免责</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>买家自述未收到</td>\n<td>+1</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>单独不足以翻转</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>轨迹扫描缺失（无末端事件）</td>\n<td>+1</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>支持「证据不足 → 待定」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逆向单 / 退回记录</td>\n<td>情境</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>撤销原妥投，改判为未妥投</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"举证责任在谁-三个场景的责任分配\">举证责任在谁：三个场景的责任分配</h2><p>复核最常吵的不是证据真假，而是<strong>谁负责举证</strong>。责任分配错了，系统会奖励沉默一方。</p>\n<p><strong>买家主张未收到（妥投扫描已存在）</strong>：平台与卡组织的通行规则倾向保护持卡人，商家需提交「交付证明」抗辩——这是 Visa 13.1 与 Mastercard 4853 争议应答的共同要求，证据含轨迹、签收、配送地址与 IP/GPS 佐证。工程含义是：判定为「准时」的订单，其交付证据必须<strong>在订单生命周期内就沉淀好</strong>。跨境件最大的坑是末端派送商不提供 ePOD，只能靠投递扫描 + 妥投地一致性抗辩，胜诉率显著下降。</p>\n<p><strong>卖家主张免责</strong>：举证责任在卖家一侧，免责事由需要<strong>外部可核验的第三方证据</strong>：承运商服务中断公告、海关放行记录、派送尝试通知。卖家自述「我按时发货了」只有出库扫描可佐证时才算数——出库晚于订单截止即刻成立卖家责任，与后续运输无关。</p>\n<p><strong>承运商拒绝服务保证退款</strong>：责任落在「承运商 commit time」与「实际事件时刻」的比对。跨境争议的根源常是平台承诺时刻与承运商承诺时刻不一致，此时复核要输出<strong>两套结论</strong>而非一方否定另一方。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复核结论如何回写-冲正与幂等\">复核结论如何回写：冲正与幂等</h2><p>复核裁定<strong>不能直接改事实</strong>，只能追加一条判定修订来触发下游状态翻转，这是「事件不可变、判定可重算」原则在复核层的延续。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;原判定 overdue&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;复核裁定 revoke&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;判定修订事件&lt;br/&gt;判定版本 v2&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D{&quot;下游动作&quot;}&#10;    D --&gt;|赔付已发| E[&quot;冲正:负向赔付 / 追偿&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|赔付未发| F[&quot;取消待发赔付&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|索赔已提| G[&quot;撤回或维持索赔&lt;br/&gt;标记不可回收成本&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|指标已计入| H[&quot;重算 OTDR / DIFOT&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"原判定 overdue\"] --&gt; B[\"复核裁定 revoke\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"判定修订事件&lt;br/&gt;判定版本 v2\"]\n    C --&gt; D{\"下游动作\"}\n    D --&gt;|赔付已发| E[\"冲正:负向赔付 / 追偿\"]\n    D --&gt;|赔付未发| F[\"取消待发赔付\"]\n    D --&gt;|索赔已提| G[\"撤回或维持索赔&lt;br/&gt;标记不可回收成本\"]\n    D --&gt;|指标已计入| H[\"重算 OTDR / DIFOT\"]</pre><p>回写必须幂等。把「判定版本 + 复核裁定版本」作为幂等键，同一裁定重复消费不产生两次冲正；赔付状态机只认从 <code>paid</code> 到 <code>reversed</code> 的<strong>单向翻转</strong>，禁止反复正反冲。跨境场景还要处理<strong>不可回收成本</strong>：赔付已发给买家、而承运商拒绝服务保证退款时，这笔钱必须单独入账而非静默核销，否则毛利失真。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反欺诈-刷申诉与虚假妥投\">反欺诈：刷申诉与虚假妥投</h2><p>复核入口开得越大，滥用面越大。<strong>买家侧刷申诉</strong>表现为高频申诉、同一收货地址聚集、金额集中在阈值以下（贴着自动裁定上限），对策是把<strong>申诉频次与历史翻转率</strong>纳入风控特征而非只看单笔证据。<strong>卖家侧虚假妥投</strong>表现为提前上报妥投或用错误地址制造「已交付」记录，对策是交叉校验：妥投地邮编与收货地偏差、妥投时间早于承运商入站扫描（时间倒置）、<code>Delivered</code> 后又被逆向揽收。时间倒置是极强的造假信号，应单列为异常事件。承运商侧「先扫后送」造成的系统性假准时则不针对单笔，通过抽查扫描与买家自述的时间分布识别，结果回灌证据权重。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复核质量指标-闭环的度量\">复核质量指标：闭环的度量</h2><p>复核系统如果不能自我度量，就会退化成成本中心。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>申诉率</td>\n<td>申诉单量 / 判定超时单量</td>\n<td>过高说明判定口径有系统性偏差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>翻转率</td>\n<td>裁定推翻单量 / 已裁定单量</td>\n<td>高翻转率 = 判定引擎精度不足的信号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>灰区占比</td>\n<td>进入人工的单量 / 自动裁定单量</td>\n<td>反映阈值与证据质量的匹配度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平均裁定时长</td>\n<td>受理到终局的时长</td>\n<td>受外部窗口约束，须显著短于最短受理窗口</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>翻转率是<strong>判定引擎的反馈信号</strong>，不是复核队列的 KPI。若某目的国翻转率持续偏高，正确反应是回看该国的时区映射或节假日日历，而非在复核层做补偿性放水：<strong>复核发现口径缺陷 → 修判定引擎，而不是让复核长期替代判定。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"合规面-一个可到达的人工入口\">合规面：一个可到达的人工入口</h2><p>监管把「自动决策须可申诉」写进了规则。欧盟《消费者权利指令》Directive 2011/83/EU 第 18 条把交付时限与逾期解除合同、14 天退款绑为消费者权利，第 19 条要求风险与交付责任的明确划分（eur-lex.europa.eu），经 Directive (EU) 2019/2161 修订后强化了时限披露与救济。美国 FTC 的 Mail, Internet, or Telephone Order Merchandise Rule（16 CFR Part 435）要求未明示发货时限时须在 30 天内发货、无法按期须通知并提供退款或延期（ftc.gov）。共同含义是：<strong>自动判定超时并据此拒赔或扣款，必须有一个人工复核入口且消费者可到达</strong>。</p>\n<p>工程落点：复核入口须在买家可见的争议渠道内可达，受理窗口与告知义务同步实现，裁定结论须可解释（输出证据摘要而非仅一个布尔值）。这与<a href=\"delivery-event-and-lateness-basis\">本章的妥投口径</a>同构——判定的可审计与复核的可解释是同一件事在流水线两端的体现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>超时判定是结论而非事实，复核与申诉是赔付出口前的第二道工序，兼担风控与合规职责。</li>\n<li>申诉方按利益方向分四类（买家 / 卖家 / 承运商 / 内部审计），同一运单须能挂载多头结论，勿争夺单布尔值。</li>\n<li>受理窗口由外部规则决定（A-to-z ~90 天、eBay MBG ~30 天、PayPal ~180 天、卡组织 ~120 天，以当期条款为准），判定快照须长期留存。</li>\n<li>裁定用加权证据函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = \\sum w_i d_i e_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 配双阈值，灰区进人工；举证责任按场景分配。</li>\n<li>复核结论只追加判定修订、触发单向状态翻转，以「判定版本 + 裁定版本」为幂等键，不可回收成本单独入账。</li>\n<li>反欺诈须同时防买家刷申诉与卖家虚假妥投（时间倒置、邮编偏差）；翻转率是判定引擎的反馈信号，发现口径缺陷应修引擎而非长期替代判定。</li>\n<li>欧盟指令 2011/83/EU 第 18/19 条、美国 16 CFR Part 435 共同要求自动判定之外存在可到达的人工复核入口。\n$$</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"超时争议复核与判定申诉","id":"超时争议复核与判定申诉"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：申诉方与诉求分类","id":"核心概念-申诉方与诉求分类"},{"level":2,"text":"受理窗口：申诉不是一个可以无限重开的口","id":"受理窗口-申诉不是一个可以无限重开的口"},{"level":2,"text":"复核裁定模型：证据权重与阈值","id":"复核裁定模型-证据权重与阈值"},{"level":2,"text":"举证责任在谁：三个场景的责任分配","id":"举证责任在谁-三个场景的责任分配"},{"level":2,"text":"复核结论如何回写：冲正与幂等","id":"复核结论如何回写-冲正与幂等"},{"level":2,"text":"反欺诈：刷申诉与虚假妥投","id":"反欺诈-刷申诉与虚假妥投"},{"level":2,"text":"复核质量指标：闭环的度量","id":"复核质量指标-闭环的度量"},{"level":2,"text":"合规面：一个可到达的人工入口","id":"合规面-一个可到达的人工入口"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"承诺时钟与例外事件顺延机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/guaranteed-delivery-sla-promise/lateness-determination/promise-clock-exception-events"},"next":{"title":"赔付规则与责任主体归属模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/guaranteed-delivery-sla-promise/auto-compensation-carrier-claim/compensation-liability-model"}}